      "title": "前蜀亡后降唐，获补武职",
      "summary": "魏王李继岌平蜀后，潘在迎获补武职；《十国春秋》又记降唐后所至诸官。",
      "sourceDate": "《九国志》平蜀后；《十国春秋》国亡降唐，后续任官未独记年月",
      "year": null,
      "precision": "undated",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "sortOrder": 11,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "jiuguozhi-v006",
          "paragraphId": "jiuguozhi-v006-p42",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "60b508d5bd8b9a3929dcd6097fd9c21bf4f418f4480734b9880465f2313750db",
          "excerpt": "魏王繼岌平蜀，補爲右職。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v046",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v046-p5",
